exports[`help for mcp 1`] = `
"Usage: stacktape mcp [options]

Starts the local Stacktape MCP (Model Context Protocol) server for coding agents.

Commands:
  mcp add                   Connects your coding agents to Stacktape: Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, VS Code (GitHub Copilot), GitHub Copilot CLI, Windsurf and OpenCode.
  mcp remove                Removes the user-level Stacktape MCP server entry that stacktape mcp add added to your coding agents.

Options:

Global options:
  -h, --help               Show help for a command or group
  -v, --version            Print the CLI version
      --json               Emit NDJSON (does not confirm operations)
      --debug              Show debug messages
      --quiet              Show errors only
      --log-level <level>  info, debug, error; quiet wins, otherwise last flag wins

Documentation: https://docs.stacktape.com/cli/"
`;

